   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two grants per turn, each alive only while its step runs. The agent's grant can call the model and nothing else; only finish.sh, sent by the DO after Claude exits, can push. Verified: PR #1 on\njakehulberg2/infisical2, opened on turn 1, updated on turn 2.",
   "originalText": "Two grants per turn, each alive only while its step runs. The agent's grant can call the model and nothing else; only finish.sh, sent by the DO after Claude exits, can push. Verified: PR #1 on\njakehulberg2/infisical2, opened on turn 1, updated on turn 2.",
