   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Stream: a WebSocket to /sessions/:id/stream with ?after=<seq> and the JWT\nas access_token. The DO replays, sends live events, and closes the socket\nwhen the session settles. The CLI holds only the agentbox JWT; the GitHub\ntoken is used once to read the login and dropped.",
   "originalText": "Stream: a WebSocket to /sessions/:id/stream with ?after=<seq> and the JWT\nas access_token. The DO replays, sends live events, and closes the socket\nwhen the session settles. The CLI holds only the agentbox JWT; the GitHub\ntoken is used once to read the login and dropped.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
