   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The box trusts the proxy's CA (baked into the image), so the proxy can decrypt, attach the credential and re-encrypt. Box and proxy share a private network,\nso the grant token never crosses the internet.",
